     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">---------- Mensagem encaminhada ----------<br>De: <b class=\"gmail_sendername\">Introdução ao R</b> <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">cursoli...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span><br>Data: 8 de dezembro de 2017 09:35<br>Assunto: Fwd: Ajuda!<br>Para: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">linguage...@googlegroups.com</a><br><br><br><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><div><div>Olá Marcia, <br></div>encaminhei sua duvida para o fórum para que todos tenham acesso<br><br></div>verifique a ordem dos seus comandos. na linha 9 vc chama medias.individuos, porém só vai criar ele depois, na linha 10. além disso, Na linha 10, os objetos que vc usa no aggregate precisam ter o mesmo tamanho<br></div>att<br></div>Vitor<br><div><div><div><div><div><div class=\"gmail_quote\">---------- Mensagem encaminhada ----------<br>De: <b class=\"gmail_sendername\">Marcia Anjos</b> <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">anj...@hotmail.com</a>&gt;</span><br>Data: 8 de dezembro de 2017 01:17<br>Assunto: Ajuda!<br>Para: &quot;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">cursoli...@gmail.com</a>&quot; &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">cursoli...@gmail.com</a>&gt;, Vitor Rios &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">vri...@gmail.com</a>&gt;<div><div><br><br><br>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">Prezados,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">Gostaria da monitoria de vcs para resolver esse exercício. </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">Sei que o erro tá no comando do calculo das médias, mas não sei como dá o comando correto.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">Medias roda no R, mas qnd lanço no notar não executa. </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\">Grata pela atenção,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols,EmojiFont,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,NotoColorEmoji,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Android Emoji&quot;,EmojiSymbols\">\r\n<p></p>\r\n<div style=\"text-align:left;color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:wf_segoe-ui_normal,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif,serif,EmojiFont;font-size:15px\">\r\n<font color=\"#999999\">________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________</font></div><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n<div style=\"text-align:left;color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:wf_segoe-ui_normal,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif,serif,EmojiFont;font-size:1